This repository contains material under different terms. Read which part a
file belongs to before reusing it.

1. Amsterdam map chart: MIT License
   Covers:
   - projects/custom-chart/src/, except projects/custom-chart/src/index.ts
     and projects/custom-chart/src/data/
   - test/
   - docs/

2. Luzmo custom chart builder: not covered by the MIT License
   Every other file comes from the Luzmo custom chart builder
   (https://github.com/luzmo-official/custom-chart-builder). These files are
   copyright Luzmo and are included with permission. The MIT License below
   does not apply to them; see the builder repository for their terms.

3. Map data: CC BY 4.0
   projects/custom-chart/src/data/city.bin.gz is derived from 3DBAG (3DGI and
   the 3D Geoinformation group at TU Delft) and TOP10NL (© Kadaster, via
   PDOK). It is licensed under CC BY 4.0
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); see README.md for the
   attribution.

4. Dependencies
   npm packages keep their own licences. Luzmo's packages, such as
   @luzmo/dashboard-contents-types and @luzmo/analytics-components-kit, are
   licensed under the Luzmo Terms of Service.

